@context: A login flow — fill fields by their label, press a button, check both outcomes.
@title: login
@tags: smoke

@var: {site} = http://localhost:8000

STEP 1: A wrong password is refused
    NAVIGATE to {site}/login.html
    FILL 'Username' field with 'ada'
    FILL 'Password' field with 'wrong'
    CLICK the 'Sign in' button
    VERIFY that 'Invalid username or password' is present

STEP 2: The right one gets in
    # FILL replaces whatever the field held, so no clearing is needed.
    FILL 'Password' field with 'lovelace'
    CLICK the 'Sign in' button
    VERIFY that 'Welcome, ada' is present
    VERIFY that 'Invalid username or password' is NOT present

STEP 3: Log out again
    CLICK the 'Logout' button
    VERIFY that 'Sign in' is present

DONE.
